Package: libassuan
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: libgpg-error (>= 1.61), libsystem
Description: IPC library for GnuPG's components
 libassuan implements the Assuan protocol, which GnuPG's programs use
 to talk to each other.

Package: libassuan-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: libassuan (= ${binary:Version}), libgpg-error-dev (>= 1.61)
Description: IPC library for GnuPG's components: development files
 The header, the pkg-config file and the autoconf macro for building
 programs against libassuan.
